WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Install the pre-release. Open a trusted folder. Run FW Mem Guard: Run Demo.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Flash grows by 51,200 bytes. RAM grows by 27,136 bytes. This is allocated section memory, not runtime peak use.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Both total-usage checks pass. Both growth limits fail intentionally. BUDGET_EXCEEDED is expected, not an installation error.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The reduced JSON opens in an unsaved editor tab. Review it before Save As. The extension does not upload it.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Install FW Mem Guard from Visual Studio Marketplace. Guided project setup supports GNU ld and ARM ELF32 little-endian, one Flash/RAM pair.

